<figure class="reservations" data-r57-reservation aria-labelledby="r57-reservation-title"><figcaption id="r57-reservation-title"><span>Figure 1</span> Same room and overlapping instants must both hold</figcaption>
<label>Proposed reservation <select><option value="adjacent">R1 · 19:00–20:00</option><option value="overlap">R1 · 18:30–19:30</option><option value="other">R2 · 18:30–19:30</option></select></label>
<div class="axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>18:00</span><span>19:00</span><span>20:00</span></div>
<div class="lane"><b>Existing R1</b><div class="track"><div class="bar existing">[18:00, 19:00)</div></div></div>
<div class="lane"><b data-room>Proposed R1</b><div class="track"><div class="bar proposed" data-bar>[19:00, 20:00)</div></div></div>
<p data-decision aria-live="polite">Same room: yes. Overlap: no. Permitted; adjacent half-open intervals share no instant.</p>
<p class="caption">Illustrative intervals on 4 November 2026, all times UTC. Square bracket includes the start; round bracket excludes the end. This is a room-reservation variant, independent of session S501’s capacity race. The native worksheet checks the same three cases.</p></figure>
<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll('[data-r57-reservation]')){const select=root.querySelector('select');const draw=()=>{const mode=select.value,adj=mode==='adjacent';root.querySelector('[data-room]').textContent=mode==='other'?'Proposed R2':'Proposed R1';const bar=root.querySelector('[data-bar]');bar.textContent=adj?'[19:00, 20:00)':'[18:30, 19:30)';bar.style.marginLeft=adj?'50%':'25%';root.querySelector('[data-decision]').textContent=adj?'Same room: yes. Overlap: no. Permitted; adjacent half-open intervals share no instant.':mode==='other'?'Same room: no. Overlap: yes. Permitted; the exclusion rule concerns pairs in the same room.':'Same room: yes. Overlap: yes. Refused by the exclusion constraint.'};select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw()}
</script>
<style>
.reservations{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:1rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt);margin:2rem 0}.reservations figcaption span{display:block;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.reservations label{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;align-items:center;margin:1.2rem 0;font:.9rem system-ui}.reservations select{font:inherit;max-width:100%;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.5rem}.axis{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:.8rem system-ui;margin-bottom:.6rem}.lane{margin:.8rem 0;font:.85rem system-ui}.lane b{display:block;margin-bottom:.4rem}.track{height:3.2rem;border-block:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.4rem 0}.bar{height:2.3rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:50%;border:2px solid var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.8rem;background:var(--color-surface);white-space:nowrap}.proposed{border-style:dashed;margin-left:50%}.reservations [data-decision]{min-height:5em;border-left:3px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding-left:.8rem}.caption{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-text);outline-offset:3px}
</style>
